@startuml sequence01
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber

title Sequence View - Level 1\nSubmit Vessel Visit Notification (System-Level Flow)

actor "Shipping Agent\nRepresentative" as SAR
participant "Port Management\nSystem" as PMS
participant "Identity\nProvider" as IDP
participant "Email\nService" as Email

== Authentication ==
SAR -> PMS: Access system
PMS -> IDP: Authenticate user
IDP -> IDP: Verify credentials
IDP --> PMS: Return access token
PMS --> SAR: Grant access with role-based UI

== Submit Vessel Visit Notification ==
SAR -> PMS: Fill visit notification form\n(vessel, ETA/ETD, cargo manifest)
SAR -> PMS: Submit notification
PMS -> PMS: Validate data\n(ISO 6346 container IDs,\nbusiness rules)
PMS -> PMS: Save notification\n(status: "submitted")
PMS --> SAR: Display success message

== View Notification Status ==
SAR -> PMS: View my notifications
PMS -> PMS: Retrieve notifications\nfor this representative
PMS --> SAR: Display notifications list\nwith current status

note right of PMS
  System manages complete
  visit lifecycle:
  - In Progress
  - Submitted
  - Pending Approval
  - Approved (with dock)
  - Rejected (with reason)
end note

@enduml